SpacemiT K1 first-stage bootloader

Source: https://github.com/spacemit-com/uboot-2022.10
Release: k1-bl-v2.2.11-release
License: GPL-2.0-or-later (see LICENSE.spacemit-fsbl).

Exports the vendor SPL in its FSBL container, using the board's official
k1_defconfig. The shared U-Boot patch set backports the subsequent LPDDR4X
training and QSPI fixes. The u-boot-spacemit-k1 package builds U-Boot separately.
